WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:05.743
Cora and Mo followed the arrow.

2
00:00:05.744 --> 00:00:10.007
Others were swimming toward the surface too.

3
00:00:10.008 --> 00:00:14.711
"Everyone wants to see the sky colors!" Cora said.

4
00:00:14.712 --> 00:00:21.968
Mo laughed. "Even Walt is going!"

5
00:00:21.969 --> 00:00:27.314
"Walt! Do you like the lights?" Cora asked.

6
00:00:27.315 --> 00:00:32.598
Walt shrugged. "They're okay.

7
00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:43.242
Sometimes they make too much noise."

8
00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:47.195
Soon everyone reached the surface.

9
00:00:47.196 --> 00:00:51.000
They bobbed happily in the water.

10
00:00:51.001 --> 00:00:56.176
"I hope the show starts soon," Cora said.

11
00:00:56.177 --> 00:01:00.601
Just then Cora saw something move in the sky.

12
00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:03.953
"The sky colors?" she thought.

13
00:01:03.954 --> 00:01:09.267
No! It was a huge seagull!

14
00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:12.816
The seagull swooped low over the water.

15
00:01:12.817 --> 00:01:18.419
Cora gulped. "Uh-oh!" she thought.

16
00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:22.987
"It's looking for food. And . . ."

17
00:01:22.988 --> 00:01:25.813
The seagull spotted Mo!

18
00:01:25.814 --> 00:01:32.065
"Mo!" Cora shouted. "Quick! Puff up!"

19
00:01:32.066 --> 00:01:36.047
Mo made himself big and spiky.

20
00:01:36.048 --> 00:01:39.835
"Grr!" The seagull squawked in anger.

21
00:01:39.836 --> 00:01:43.431
Then it flew away.

22
00:01:43.432 --> 00:01:50.136
"Phew!" Mo said. "Thanks!"

23
00:01:50.137 --> 00:01:54.789
"You're safe now," Cora said.

24
00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:57.772
"And look! The show is starting."

25
00:01:57.773 --> 00:02:00.840
Boom!

26
00:02:00.841 --> 00:02:03.745
"What's that sound?" Mo said.

27
00:02:03.746 --> 00:02:12.689
"The sky colors!" Cora said. "They're loud."

28
00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:15.858
Then she heard a soft sound.

29
00:02:15.859 --> 00:02:21.732
"Help me! I'm in danger!"

